.problem
Diagnostic does not reliably test SLU2 and SLU3 with
external jumpers. Documentation needed to define
hardware configuration needed to test SLU's with
external jumpers.
.solution
Hardware configuration setting (HW3) bit 5=1
disables the programmable SLU loopback and
allows you to substitute external jumpers.
Jumper pins 2 and 3 on SLU2 and jumper pins 2
and 3 on SLU3.
